        "optional": true,
        "description": "The active dot is rendered on the closest data point when user interacts with the chart. Options: - `false`: dots do not change on user activity; both active and inactive dots follow the `dot` prop (see below) - `true`: renders the active dot with default settings - `object`: the props of the active dot. This will be merged with the internal calculated props of the active dot - `ReactElement`: the custom active dot element - `function`: a render function of the custom active dot"
