        "description": "Customize how the charts will synchronize tooltips and brushes. `index`: synchronize using the data index in the data array. Index expects that all data has the same length. `value`: synchronize using the data value on categorical axis (categorical: XAxis in horizontal layout, YAxis in vertical layout). function: a custom sync method which receives tick and data as argument and returns an index."
