        "description": "If true, then it will listen to container size changes and adapt the SVG chart accordingly. If false, then it renders the chart at the specified width and height and will stay that way even if the container size changes. This is similar to ResponsiveContainer but without the need for an extra wrapper component. The `responsive` prop also uses standard CSS sizing rules, instead of custom resolution logic (like ResponsiveContainer does)."
